      "basis": "rust_behavioral_regression",
      "test": "context_contract.rs::actual_spend_output_proofs_verify_and_finalize",
      "contract": "bundled TRON parameters generate, contextually verify, accumulate, and finalize two spends totaling 12 plus three outputs totaling 11 with native value balance 1; an inconsistent supplied balance is rejected without signing or output mutation, while FinalCheckNew accepts the balanced commitments and fixed Java field shapes remain enforced"
