      "contract": "free atomically retires and removes a same-handle entry, rejects cloned-but-unadmitted and later operations without mutation, waits for admitted work to complete, preserves typed wrong-kind/double-free/bound failures, keeps retiring-active slots reserved until quiescence, and never blocks unrelated handles"
